{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05319","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 张锡","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九秋霜景净，千门晓望通。\n仙游光御路，瑞塔迥凌空。\n菊彩扬尧日，萸香遶舜风。\n天文丽辰象，窃拚仰层穹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}